Not quite — there is a JSON syntax error (an extra closing } right before ]), which would cause Kanime to reject the file as invalid JSON.

Also a couple of minor mismatches:

release_notes still says KOpenSubtitle v1.0.0 instead of v1.0.1.
release_notes mentions KAnimeHeaven Extractor, which was removed from your plugins list (keep it removed below if intentional, or re-add the kanimeheaven entry if you still want it in the catalog).
If you already published plugin_config_version: 5, bump it to 6 so users get notified of the update.

