publish the latest changes in my github

Published all latest changes to origin/main (https://github.com/Jubiar01/kanime.git) at commit b7784bf (33 files changed).

Included in this Push
First-run onboarding (OnboardingScreen.kt) with required SAF folder picker, permissions, and live catalog update/plugin installs.
Performance & R8 optimizations (KanimeImageLoader.kt, Glass.kt, proguard-rules.pro).
Release notes & catalog overhaul (PluginManager.kt, PluginsScreen.kt, PluginCatalogTest.kt) — with plugins.json kept at v1.
Card polish & date formatting (AnimeCard.kt, EpisodeCard.kt, AnimeDateFormatter.kt).
Subtitle plugin & KOpenSubtitle integration (PlayerDialog.kt, PluginBridge.kt, SubtitleOffsetHelper.kt) with Use KOpenSubtitle toggle, real-time Subtitle Sync, clean soft-subtitle off behavior, and MAL/AniList/episode metadata passing.
Gradle & privacy: build.gradle.kts scopes unqualified installDebug/installRelease to :app, and .gitignore keeps kopensubtitle-plugin/ excluded alongside your other private plugin modules.
